OL,3,GNEWSARestricted driver jailed for
OL,4,Acausing 100mph fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restricted driver who was travelling
OL,7,Fat more than 100mph (161km/h) when he
OL,8,Fcaused a crash which killed a man and
OL,9,Fleft four women seriously injured,
OL,10,Fincluding one who now has to use a
OL,11,Fwheelchair, has been handed a five-year
OL,12,Fsentence.
OL,14,FJudge Richard Greene KC told
OL,15,F23-year-old Lewis Burtney, with an
OL,16,Faddress on the Riverside Road in
OL,17,FBallynahinch, it was clear the incident
OL,18,Fwas due to his "grossly excessive
OL,19,Fspeed".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
