OL,3,GNEWSARestricted driver jailed for
OL,4,Acausing 100mph fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurtney's sentence will be served
OL,7,Fequally between prison and licence
OL,8,Fconditions.
OL,10,FForty-nine-year-old James Smyth was
OL,11,Fpronounced dead at the scene in
OL,12,FDundrum, County Down, in December 2021.
